<view class="page">
  <view class="hero compact">
    <view class="topline">
      <view class="badge"><view class="dot"></view><text>联系反馈</text></view>
      <text class="top-note">客服</text>
    </view>
    <text class="hero-title">联系与反馈</text>
    <text class="hero-desc">在线客服、反馈和邮箱咨询都保留，文案更贴合志愿填报场景。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="content">
    <view class="section">
      <button class="row-item button-row" open-type="contact">
        <view class="mark">客</view>
        <view>
          <text class="row-title">在线客服</text>
          <text class="row-desc">工作日 9:00-18:00，处理登录、支付和报告问题。</text>
        </view>
        <text class="state-label">进入</text>
      </button>

      <button class="row-item button-row" open-type="feedback">
        <view class="mark now">反</view>
        <view>
          <text class="row-title">意见反馈 / 问题上报</text>
          <text class="row-desc">报告内容异常、生成失败、页面问题。</text>
        </view>
        <text class="state-label">进入</text>
      </button>

      <view class="row-item" bindtap="copyEmail">
        <view class="mark">邮</view>
        <view>
          <text class="row-title">商务咨询</text>
          <text class="row-desc">paul7in3wechat@outlook.com</text>
        </view>
        <text class="state-label">复制</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section warn">
      <text class="paragraph">涉及具体志愿表复核，请优先添加老师 VX 或提供完整分数、位次、省份和选科信息。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
